{"id":"eb0a10cf7fd70a66","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-np-certificate-search.md","title":"P等于NP时可寻找每个NP证书","display":"thm-np-certificate-search — P等于NP时可寻找每个NP证书","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-np-certificate-search","aliases":["28-thm-np-certificate-search"],"display":"thm-np-certificate-search — P等于NP时可寻找每个NP证书","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.18 and proof","source_printed_pages":"55","source_pdf_pages":"81","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-np-certificate-search"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-np-certificate-search</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-certificate-search — P等于NP时可寻找每个NP证书"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Theorem 2.18 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"55"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"81"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(V\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(z)\\in\\Sigma^1\">\\(\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(z)\\in\\Sigma^1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,u))=\\langle1\\rangle)\">\\(\\forall x\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,u))=\\langle1\\rangle)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见所列本地上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1\\rangle\\)</span> 为单字符字串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\Longrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\left[|f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\Longrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\left[|f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>语言E={〈x,v〉: v是某个被V接受的p(|x|)位证书的前缀}在NP。假设P=NP即可判定E。先查空前缀，随后依次查v0是否可扩展；可则取0，否则取1。最多p(|x|)+1次调用便得到完整证书；无证书时返回固定串，所以得到总FP函数。长度0的证书已由首次查询处理。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 2.18 and proof；印刷 pp.55 / PDF pp.81。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的函数；$V\\in\\mathbf{FP}$ 且 $\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(z)\\in\\Sigma^1$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，$\\forall x\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,u))=\\langle1\\rangle)$。$\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}$ 见所列本地上游；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，$\\langle1\\rangle$ 为单字符字串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall z\\in\\Sigma^*\\;V(z)\\in\\Sigma^1","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists u\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,u))=\\langle1\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP},\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\Longrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall x\\in L\\;\\left[|f(x)|=p(|x|)\\land V(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,f(x)))=\\langle1\\rangle\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1963,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tmsat]]、[[28-thm-tmsat-np-complete]]、[[28-df-binary-integer-programming]]、[[28-thm-binary-integer-programming-np-complete]]、[[28-thm-np-certificate-search]]。"}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","adb92775ec020a0b","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}